<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>

    <!-- NuGet package metadata -->
    <PackageId>Kuwantima</PackageId>
    <Version>1.3.0</Version>
    <Authors>Cole Larson</Authors>
    <Description>A glass-glow design system for Avalonia UI. 15 styled controls, automatic light/dark theming, Fluent palette integration.</Description>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/Votskwani/Kuwantima</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/Votskwani/Kuwantima</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageTags>avalonia;ui;theme;glass;design-system</PackageTags>
    <!-- Version-coupled: rewrite this every release. It is on the Version Bump Checklist in
         CLAUDE.md for that reason - stale release notes are worse than none. -->
    <PackageReleaseNotes>v1.3.0 - The accent re-ramp.

Accent states now darken on interaction instead of lightening. That lets accent text, checkmarks and radio dots be light and crisp while clearing WCAG AA on every state (4.53 / 7.32 / 10.50). Orange moves off the pressed fill onto the border and a new press glow.

Contrast fixes in both themes: the dark hover tint no longer washes out the text sitting on it, and placeholder and muted label text are now readable on glass panels and on hovered controls.

Upgrades to Avalonia 12.1.3.

No migration needed - nothing renamed or removed, same single StyleInclude entry point, still net10.0. Accent and checked controls do look different: they darken on hover rather than lightening, and their text is light rather than dark.</PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <AvaloniaResource Include="Styles\**\*.axaml" />
    <AvaloniaResource Include="Theme\**\*.axaml" />
    <None Include="..\README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Avalonia" Version="12.1.3" />
    <PackageReference Include="Avalonia.Themes.Fluent" Version="12.1.3" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
